	(property "Description" "DS3231MZ+TRL, SO-8. I2C0x68, timekeeping +/-5ppm. Pin1 32kHz and pin4 RST not connected; pin5 GND,6 VBAT,7 SDA,8 SCL. No battery charging. MEMS variant: SQW1Hz only; 32kHz not precision. Check RTC firmware support; stock radio GPIO unchanged. Approved Danomsk S4.6 substitution, including reduced timekeeping accuracy."
